        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.421,
            0.847,
            0.462
          ],
          "content": "？ Observe the given sequences of numbers. Identify the change after each term and extend the pattern:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.478,
            0.365,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": "(a) $4 , 4   \\frac { 3 } { 1 0 } , 4   \\frac { 6 } { 1 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.518,
            0.809,
            0.555
          ],
          "content": "(b) $8 \\frac{2}{10}, 8 \\frac{7}{10}, 9 \\frac{2}{10}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.559,
            0.354,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": "(c) $7 \\frac{6}{10}, 8 \\frac{7}{10};$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.599,
            0.809,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": "(d) $5   \\frac { 7 } { 1 0 }   ,   5   \\frac { 3 } { 1 0 }   ;$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.639,
            0.809,
            0.675
          ],
          "content": "(e) $1 3   \\frac { 5 } { 1 0 }   ,   1 3 ,   1 2   \\frac { 5 } { 1 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.678,
            0.809,
